<<!DOCTYPE type=`memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki` spec=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/memetic-wikitext`>>

<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.law.pins`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "pin a law meme so it heads the law index"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.law.pins"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.law.pins"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.law.pins"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.law.pins ~ a law meme added to the pin set, heading the law index

The pin set (`$:/config/lares/law/pins`, a TiddlyWiki filter) takes one `[[uri]]` run (or drops a `-[[uri]]` run that kept the title out) and lands through `tiddler_put` in this face's working layer of its daemon wiki, against the base it read, keeping its layout; house canon takes no byte. A pin orders canon law and adds none: a title no canon law holds refuses `law-pin-absent`.

One already pinned answers `decision: "noop"`; a pin set that moved under the read refuses `law-pins-moved` (call again). The answer carries {title, uri, decision, pinned, text, hash, bag}. The pin set lives apart from every law meme, so the AI seat may pin as the operator may.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ pin-the-address-law

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`pin-the-address-law` params=`uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/lar-uri ~ read the address law right after the Mu family`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ uri · face

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`uri` params=`takes/lar-address needs/required seat/1 ~ the law meme by its lar: address, one title with no whitespace, brackets, braces or bar`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the pin set lands in the face's own working layer through the tiddler door, against the base it read; house canon takes no byte; reversible and trusted, so the seat runs it on the operator's loop`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ law-pin-absent · law-pins-moved · usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`law-pin-absent` params=`cure/[[engine.law.indexes]] ~ no canon law stands at the title in the worn face's daemon wiki (a pin orders canon law and adds none); nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`law-pins-moved` params=`cure/[[engine.law.pins uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/lar-uri]] ~ the pin set moved since the read; run the pin again`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.law.pins uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/lar-uri]] ~ name the law meme by its lar: address; a pin names one title with no whitespace, brackets, braces or bar`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ pinned · noop

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`pinned` params=`exit/0 fields/[[title uri decision pinned text hash bag]] ~ the pin set landed with the title in it; decision reads put`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`noop` params=`exit/0 ~ the title already stands pinned; the pin set moved nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli · mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares law pin

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares law pin]] ~ the terminal; the law meme rides as <uri>`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! law_pin

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`spells/law_pin omits/face ~ the seat; answers the body`>>
```

